{"games":[{"id":3198259055,"name":"SoulShatters Test Place","desc":"Teleporting to a different server = New Update. Shutdown = Emergency Fix.\n\nIn this game, it's kill or be killed. This is a fighting game, \"randoming\" doesn't exist.\n\nWelcome to SoulShatters! There are many planned changes and features that aren't, won't, may, and will be in the final release.\n\nCurrent Characters Include: Sans, Glitchtale Chara, Storyshift Chara, Undyne, Bete Noire, Asriel Dreemurr, Frisk, XTale Sans/Chara, Delta Sans, Glitchtale Frisk, Sakuya Izayoi, Stevonnie, and Carrot God!\n\nControls:\n\n[LMB/RMB]: Melee Combat \n[F]: Block \n[R]: Teleport/Transportation \n[Left Control]: Run \n[Double Tapping any Movement Key]: Dash (Instantly makes you run) \n[MMB/L]: Lock/unlock your cursor. (Required for certain moves) \n[1-9]: Special Attacks (Will require Mana) \n[Q/E]: Change modes for certain characters. \n\nKeep up to date with changes, updates, and planned features. ","path":"/game/3198259055-soulshatters-test-place","slug":"3198259055-soulshatters-test-place","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c5c2ee7b64b7734f96c574bc4c078d63f0af5058cb8e09274429ab95b9c4267e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dcdd9494181051a57bc4c5cf0e34ae1a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":162988362,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-06T16:33:40.261Z","creator":{"name":"SenatorBunny","type":"User"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2622527242,"name":"SCP rBreach (Classic)","desc":"Here for nostalgia? Check out the new release! : https://www.roblox.com/games/130114877732645/\n\nRoblox recreation of the old Garry's Mod gamemode, \"Breach\", with my own changes and additions.","path":"/game/2622527242-scp-rbreach","slug":"2622527242-scp-rbreach","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4608833ce9f1ed3eff54135d057529df4d7da1c36c638f88b4bd14654e3a5544.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-4e48f302076e5b33adf9949969816f8a/1